    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d528-a2">

                <pb facs="0634" n="552" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg552"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 2.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 28, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received your kind communication of the 17th instant, with a package
                    sealed and addressed to my husband, by the republic of Buenos Ayres, through the
                    Hon. W. Seward.</p>
                <p>I will try to send it to my husband by the first safe opportunity that offers.
                    Independence and the republic!</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MARGARITA MAZA DE JUAREZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Matias Romero, Minister Plenipotentiary of the
                            Mexican Republic, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
